# Gradient Boosting Algorithm

## General Procedure

### Step 1: Initialize model

For squared error regression:

$$
F_0(x)
=
\bar y
$$

### Step 2: Repeat for $m=1,\dots,M$

#### Compute pseudo-residuals

$$
r_{im}
=
-
\frac{
\partial \ell(y_i,F(x_i))
}{
\partial F(x_i)
}
\Bigg|_{F=F_m}
